 8.58%, basket_size 7.8%), which is small enough for median imputation. Credit_score and page_views are complete, and target is complete with a usable 69/31 class split. The verdict is needs_cleaning rather than cannot_determine because the issues are clearly diagnosable from the profile; do the sentinel cleanup, choose an explicit imputation/encoding strategy for the high-missing categoricals, then re-profile.", "verdict": "needs_cleaning", "confidence": "medium", "omitted": false, "rejections": 0, "rejection_kinds": [], "provider_calls": 1, "latency_ms": 6213.1, "scored": {"entity": false, "value": false, "omission": false}, "admissible_columns": 24, "admissible_statistics": 13, "schema_bytes": 1882, "sampling": {"temperature": 1.0}, "provenance": {"record_schema": 3, "started_at": "2026-09-24T16:11:33+00:00", "repo_commit": "383f8c4", "tree_dirty": true, "contract": "evidence_contract.PROFILE"}}
